nightpanel (0.2.5-5) unstable; urgency=low

  * gnome adapter: restore the pure-black desktop background on apply (the Saab
    design canvas), now configurable. Default blacks out the wallpaper (clears
    picture-uri + picture-uri-dark, paints primary-color #0A0A0A); opt out by
    creating <config-dir>/keep-wallpaper. Reverses the 0.2.x "keep wallpaper"
    default; revert() still restores the wallpaper on toggle-off.

 -- Greg Felice <greg@gregfelice.com>  Wed, 10 Jun 2026 20:08:23 -0400

nightpanel (0.2.5-4) unstable; urgency=low

  * Recommend fonts-inter + fonts-jetbrains-mono — the UI is designed in Inter
    with JetBrains Mono key labels; without them GTK falls back to Cantarell /
    generic monospace and the design renders wrong.

 -- Greg Felice <greg@gregfelice.com>  Tue, 09 Jun 2026 23:55:00 -0400

nightpanel (0.2.5-3) unstable; urgency=low

  * Fix GUI crash on launch (ModuleNotFoundError): ship the modules the desktop
    app needs but the meson install lists omitted — services/theme_service +
    tiling_service + np-host, views/appearance + profiles + setup, and the
    package __main__ + player_app. The toggle path was unaffected.

 -- Greg Felice <greg@gregfelice.com>  Tue, 09 Jun 2026 23:30:00 -0400

nightpanel (0.2.5-2) unstable; urgency=low

  * prerm: best-effort revert of an active theme as the invoking desktop user
    on `remove` only (never on upgrade), so removing while toggled on does not
    leave the system themed with no revert tool.

 -- Greg Felice <greg@gregfelice.com>  Tue, 09 Jun 2026 20:15:00 -0400

